<section class="mb-(--spacing-md) flex flex-col gap-y-(--spacing-sm)"><h2 class="scroll-mt-(--spacing-md) [--inline-code-border:] [--inline-code-px:var(--spacing-xs)] [--inline-code-aside-ps:none] [--inline-code-mx:0.1em] break-words font-bold text-2xl mb-(--spacing-sm)">Objectives</h2><p class="[display:var(--p-inside-li-display,block)] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Automated testing is a crucial aspect of API stability to ensure the changes we make do not introduce (regression) bugs to existing APIs.</p><p class="[display:var(--p-inside-li-display,block)] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">We&#x27;ll be using these packages that were chosen for their DX (developer experience):</p><ul class="[--p-inside-li-display:contents] [--inline-code-word-break:break-all] [--link-overflow-wrap:break-all] mb-(--spacing-sm) list-disc list-inside flex flex-col gap-y-(--spacing-xs)">
<li><code class="text-base [word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] font-medium font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--color-base-300))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--color-base-content))] px-(--spacing-xs) py-[0.1em]">vitest</code> as test runner, building test cases.</li>
<li><code class="text-base [word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] font-medium font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--color-base-300))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--color-base-content))] px-(--spacing-xs) py-[0.1em]">supertest</code> for API testing, setting headers and payloads.</li>
</ul></section>
