<section class="mb-(--spacing-md) flex flex-col gap-y-(--spacing-sm)"><h2 class="scroll-mt-(--spacing-md) [--inline-code-border:] [--inline-code-px:var(--spacing-xs)] [--inline-code-aside-ps:none] [--inline-code-mx:0.1em] break-words font-bold text-2xl mb-(--spacing-sm)">4/9 Install Packages</h2><pre><div class="w-full my-(--spacing-md) grid lg:max-w-[1000px] [align-items:start] rounded-md bg-(--color-base-200) relative"><header class="text-xs font-medium grid [grid-auto-flow:column] items-center ps-4 pe-2 py-2 rounded-tl-md rounded-tr-md [grid-column:1] [grid-row:1] gap-x-(--spacing-sm) border-b-(--color-base-100) border-dotted sticky top-0 bg-inherit [grid-template-columns:max-content]"><div class="flex gap-x-(--spacing-xs)"><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-(--color-base-300)"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-(--color-base-300)"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-(--color-base-300)"></div></div><span class="font-custom justify-self-start">Bash</span><button class="box-content text-sm cursor-pointer py-(--spacing-xs) px-(--spacing-sm) flex items-center gap-x-[1ch] rounded-lg hover:!bg-(--color-base-100) focus:outline-none transition !text-xs justify-self-end z-99"><svg class="!w-[0.9em] !h-[0.9em]"></svg>Copy</button></header><pre style="height:unset;min-height:300px" class="[grid-column:1] flex flex-col [justify-content:center] gap-y-(--spacing-sm) px-4 text-sm text-z overflow-x-auto pb-2 transition-[height]"><code class="text-sm font-normal font-mono leading-relaxed overflow-y-hidden relative before:w-10 before:content-[&#x27;$&#x27;] before:me-2 before:text-gray-600">pnpm add express dotenv -D typescript @types/node @types/express tsx</code></pre></div></pre><p class="[display:var(--p-inside-li-display,block)] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Why we need these:</p><ul class="[--p-inside-li-display:contents] [--inline-code-word-break:break-all] [--link-overflow-wrap:break-all] mb-(--spacing-sm) list-disc list-inside flex flex-col gap-y-(--spacing-xs)">
<li><code class="text-base [word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] font-medium font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--color-base-300))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--color-base-content))] px-(--spacing-xs) py-[0.1em]">express</code> is the backend framework</li>
<li><code class="text-base [word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] font-medium font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--color-base-300))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--color-base-content))] px-(--spacing-xs) py-[0.1em]">typescript</code> TS compiler</li>
<li><code class="text-base [word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] font-medium font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--color-base-300))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--color-base-content))] px-(--spacing-xs) py-[0.1em]">@types/node</code> <code class="text-base [word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] font-medium font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--color-base-300))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--color-base-content))] px-(--spacing-xs) py-[0.1em]">@types/express</code> Type definitions for the TS Compiler to ensure our code passes all static type checks.
<span class="italic me-1">VSCode</span> also uses them for type hints and autocomplete.</li>
<li><code class="text-base [word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] font-medium font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--color-base-300))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--color-base-content))] px-(--spacing-xs) py-[0.1em]">tsx</code> to restart our <code class="text-base [word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] font-medium font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--color-base-300))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--color-base-content))] px-(--spacing-xs) py-[0.1em]">.ts</code> server when file changes.</li>
<li><code class="text-base [word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] font-medium font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--color-base-300))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--color-base-content))] px-(--spacing-xs) py-[0.1em]">dotenv</code> for managing environment variables incl. secrets</li>
</ul></section>
